sentences.text:
Hence, we proceed to pass following;
ORDER (i) Special Civil Application is allowed;
(ii) A writ of mandamus is issued to respondent No.3 to pass the award in respect of the land owned by the petitioners expeditiously and at any rate within an outer limit of eight weeks from the date of receipt of the copy of the order in accordance with the Right to Fair Compensation and Patel Navnitbhai Maganbhai vs R B Gameti Dy Collector on 13 April, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/127078374/
1 Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013;

